{"id":58939,"mal_id":58939,"title":"Sakamoto Days","englishTitle":"Sakamoto Days","title_english":"Sakamoto Days","alternative_titles":{"synonyms":[],"en":"Sakamoto Days","ja":"SAKAMOTO DAYS"},"synopsis":"The name Tarou Sakamoto once instilled fear in every villain. No other professional hitman matched his prowess, and fellow assassins revered him. However, Sakamoto fell in love. In five short years, he married, became a father, put on some weight, and traded his weapons for an apron as he became the owner of a humble convenience store.\n\nAlthough Sakamoto is decidedly retired, he finds his old life of crime hard to shake off. His former partner, Shin Asakura, reappears and resolves to stay with Sakamoto's family under their strict no-kill rule. To make matters worse, a large bounty is placed on Sakamoto's head. Numerous assassins now pursue him—but they are in for a surprise. Sakamoto has not lost his edge, and no matter what tricks his enemies pull, he will fight off every last one to protect his dear family.\n\n[Written by MAL Rewrite]","synopsis_es":"El nombre Tarou Sakamoto alguna vez infundió miedo en todos los villanos. Ningún otro asesino a sueldo profesional igualaba su destreza y sus compañeros asesinos lo reverenciaban. Sin embargo, Sakamoto se enamoró. En cinco cortos años, se casó, se convirtió en padre, ganó algo de peso y cambió sus armas por un delantal mientras se convertía en dueño de una humilde tienda de conveniencia.\n\nAunque Sakamoto está decididamente retirado, le resulta difícil deshacerse de su antigua vida criminal. Su ex compañero, Shin Asakura, reaparece y decide quedarse con la familia de Sakamoto bajo su estricta regla de no matar. Para empeorar las cosas, se ofrece una gran recompensa por la cabeza de Sakamoto. Ahora lo persiguen numerosos asesinos, pero se llevarán una sorpresa. Sakamoto no ha perdido su ventaja y, sin importar los trucos que le hagan sus enemigos, luchará hasta el último de ellos para proteger a su querida familia.\n\n[Escrito por MAL Rewrite]","type":"TV","media_type":"tv","status":"finished_airing","averageEpisodeDurationSeconds":1427,"average_episode_duration":1427,"startDate":"2025-01-11","start_date":"2025-01-11","endDate":"2025-03-22","end_date":"2025-03-22","season":"winter","year":2025,"start_season":{"year":2025,"season":"winter"},"episodes":11,"num_episodes":11,"score":7.58,"mean":7.58,"numListUsers":546768,"num_list_users":546768,"genres":[{"id":1,"name":"Action"},{"id":50,"name":"Adult Cast"},{"id":4,"name":"Comedy"},{"id":68,"name":"Organized Crime"},{"id":27,"name":"Shounen"}],"studios":[{"id":73,"name":"TMS Entertainment"}],"pictures":[],"backdrop_url":null,"logo_url":null,"tmdb_id":null,"tmdb_updated_at":null,"images":{"jpg":{"image_url":"https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1026/146459.webp","large_image_url":"https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1026/146459l.webp"}},"main_picture":{"medium":"https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1026/146459.webp","large":"https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1026/146459l.webp"},"trailer":{"images":{"maximum_image_url":"https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1026/146459l.webp"}},"broadcast":{"day":"saturday","time":"23:00","day_of_the_week":"saturday","start_time":"23:00","timezone":"Asia/Tokyo","string":"saturday 23:00"},"rank":1896,"popularity":480,"rating":"r","simkl_id":null,"episodes_data":[],"specials_data":[],"characters":[],"num_scoring_users":259818,"nsfw":"white","created_at":"2024-05-27T13:00:50+00:00","updated_at":"2025-02-22T16:54:50+00:00","source":"manga","background":null,"related_anime":[{"node":{"id":60285,"title":"Sakamoto Days Part 2","main_picture":{"medium":"https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1758/148719.webp","large":"https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1758/148719l.webp"}},"relation_type":"sequel","relation_type_formatted":"Sequel"}],"related_manga":[],"recommendations":[{"node":{"id":50265,"title":"Spy x Family","main_picture":{"medium":"https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/a